From 743651fc5f7d4849c3e688d8ce2b660e721d574e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 18:06:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(highlight): add PHP syntax highlighting and context
 lines

Register `.php` files with the tree-sitter-php grammar (using its bundled
highlight queries) for diff syntax highlighting, and add a PHP context
query so sticky context lines show the enclosing class/function/control
blocks.

Closes #156
---
